<div class="legal-summary"><h2>In plain words</h2><ul>
<li>Clean Rows sells custom B2B prospect lists to <strong>businesses only</strong>.</li>
<li>You approve a sample, we build to your agreed brief, and you pay per list. No subscription, no seats, no minimum.</li>
<li>You are responsible for using the data lawfully: honour opt-outs, follow outreach laws, and do not resell the raw data.</li>
<li>If a list does not match the agreed brief, we rebuild it free or refund you. See our <a href="/refund">Refund Policy</a>.</li>
